<mxCell id="n24" value="Amazon ECR" style="points=[[0,0,0],[0.25,0,0],[0.5,0,0],[0.75,0,0],[1,0,0],[0,1,0],[0.25,1,0],[0.5,1,0],[0.75,1,0],[1,1,0],[0,0.25,0],[0,0.5,0],[0,0.75,0],[1,0.25,0],[1,0.5,0],[1,0.75,0]];outlineConnect=0;fontColor=#232F3E;fillColor=#ED7100;strokeColor=#ffffff;dashed=0;html=1;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;aspect=fixed;shape=mxgraph.aws4.resourceIcon;resIcon=mxgraph.aws4.ecr;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="g2"><mxGeometry x="730" y="715" width="80" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x25" value="1  The developer pushes code to the main branch on GitHub.&lt;br&gt;2  GitHub sends a signed (HMAC) webhook over HTTPS to CloudFront.&lt;br&gt;3  CloudFront reaches the internal ALB through a VPC origin, not the Internet.&lt;br&gt;4  The ALB routes the UI and /github-webhook/ to the controller; ECS injects its secrets.&lt;br&gt;5  JENKINS_HOME lives on EFS, so jobs and history survive every redeploy.&lt;br&gt;6  The controller (0 executors) starts a fresh agent task for each build.&lt;br&gt;7  The agent runs mvn verify and sends the analysis to SonarQube.&lt;br&gt;8  SonarQube stores its data in RDS for PostgreSQL.&lt;br&gt;9  After the quality gate passes, the agent uploads the jar and Docker context.&lt;br&gt;10  CodeBuild (privileged mode) reads the context from S3 and builds the image.&lt;br&gt;11  CodeBuild pushes the image, tagged commit-build number, to ECR.&lt;br&gt;12  The agent registers a new task definition and updates the sample-app service.&lt;br&gt;13  ECS pulls the new image from ECR and rolls the sample-app task." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10;fontColor=#545B64;fontStyle=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="890" width="516" height="169" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="x26" value="Jenkins on Fargate&lt;br&gt;CI/CD lab" style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=44;fontColor=#232F3E;fontStyle=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="574" y="922" width="468" height="106" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
